Reaction1040 children: mol intermediate3, mol H2O2.

Intermediate3 mol children: reaction1030.

Reaction1030 children: mol intermediate2, mol 3-buten-1-ol.

Intermediate2 mol children: reaction1020.

Reaction1020 children: mol intermediate1, mol H2.

Intermediate1 mol children: reaction1010.

Reaction1010 children: mol cyclohexanone, mol MVK.

Leaves have no children.

